  "body": "## Changelog\n\n## 🚀 Features\n- cee18db use scheduler cron expression as label (#316)\n\n## 🧰 Tasks\n- 3634498 [minor] release\n- 1a8085a Official Gradle Wrapper Validation Action (#315)\n\n## ⚙️  Dependencies\n- a894c5b **deps**: bump mockito-inline from 4.8.1 to 4.9.0 (#314)\n\nBumps [mockito-inline](https://github.com/mockito/mockito) from 4.8.1 to 4.9.0.\n- 5574072 **deps**: bump picocli from 4.6.3 to 4.7.0 (#313)\n\nBumps [picocli](https://github.com/remkop/picocli) from 4.6.3 to 4.7.0.\n\n---\n- 0b436ab jreleaser build upgrade (#318)\n\n* **build**: upgrade jreleaser\n- ff3d57e **build**: upgrade to Gradle 7.5.1 (#312)\n\n* **build**: plugins and script cleanup\n- 441cb7a Issue 296 allow complex paths (#300)\n\n* Add feature to use xpath-expressions as path with syntax \"xpath:<xpath-expression>\"\n\n\n## Contributors\nWe'd like to thank the following people for their contributions:\n- Christian Langmann ([@ChristianLangmann](https://github.com/ChristianLangmann))\n- Manik Magar ([@manikmagar](https://github.com/manikmagar))\n- dependabot[bot]"
